#!RuleTest
#test PMDA-AD0273 expect=noViolation domain=ADAE
#note "AOCC1FL has a ONE-digit index, so it does not match the first regex at all and the rule is silent. Pins finding AD0273-F1 - the two-digit-only reading - and is the discriminator against PMDA-AD0215, whose \d+ first regex would reach a variable-length index."
#library standard=adamig version=1-3
#expectViolationCount 0
dataset ADAE
col STUDYID type=Char
col USUBJID type=Char
col AEDECOD type=Char
col AOCC1FL type=Char
---
CDISCPILOT01 | 01-701-1015 | HEADACHE | Y
